# Product Completion Directive v7

Read `docs/PRODUCT_COMPLETION_DIRECTIVE.md` and `docs/QUEUE_STATE.md` before every Task.

## Goal

**Service completion** — Closed Beta → Open Beta → RC → v1.0.  
Not Epic/Sprint/Mission completion.

## Consumer

Read `current_task` in `docs/QUEUE_STATE.md` → execute at **completion standard** → update → next Task immediately.  
Queue empty → generate next queue → continue.

## Task done = all layers

Feature + UX + Animation + Loading + Error + Empty + Retry + A11y + Responsive + SEO + Perf + Analytics + Admin + History + Docs + Regression QA + Production deploy.

Feature-only = **not done**.

## Vision (immutable)

**AI Strategy Project Manager** — not chat, not reports, not business-plan writer.  
AI leads; user approves. See `docs/PRODUCT_VISION_V3.md`.

## Phases (quality bars)

Phase 1 Journey → Phase 2 Intelligence → … → Phase 16 v1.0 Ready.  
See `docs/PRODUCT_COMPLETION_DIRECTIVE.md` for full scope.

## Cycle

Implement → Self Review → QA → Build → Lint → Types → Regression → Commit → Push → Prod → Tag → Release Note → QUEUE_STATE → **next Task**

## Stop only

Build fail · Prod outage · External cost (DB/LLM/Billing/Auth) · Security · Founder vision change

## Forbidden

승인 · 질문 · 배포할까요 · 진행할까요 · Mission/Release 완료 mid-report

## Report

08:00 KST Daily only — `docs/templates/DAILY_AUTONOMOUS_REPORT.md`
